🟠 Ingress shop in shop (prod-eu-1) is failing because secret web-tls does not exist.
| 🟠 Ingress **shop** in **shop** (**prod-eu-1**) is failing because secret **web-tls** does not exist.
| Fix: renew or replace the TLS secret of ingress/shop (now **web-tls**).
| To list the keys of the Secret the pods depend on, run
| ```
